{"unit_id":"VincentJiang06__dsh-mp-automator#card-zh","repo":"VincentJiang06/dsh-mp-automator","commit":"11e7abbd0867e60ad57e97538485b2e94386f0df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mp-automator 是面向 DSH Web 会话的微信小程序自动化测试插件，通过 vince-mp CLI 连接微信开发者工具中的真实运行项目，并注册八个 mp_* 工具。它可读取页面路由、页面栈、数据和设备信息，按 WXML 选择器查询元素位置与可见状态，点击、输入、长按、导航或注入扫码内容，查看控制台并保存截图。操作前可检查编译新鲜度；截图会提供几何摘要，支持图片输入的模型还可收到受会话预算限制的 PNG。适合在小程序项目目录里让 DSH agent 执行交互测试；需要 Node、微信开发者工具及 vince-mp CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:311-754","lib/cli.js:232-263"]}
{"unit_id":"VincentJiang06__dsh-mp-automator#card-en","repo":"VincentJiang06/dsh-mp-automator","commit":"11e7abbd0867e60ad57e97538485b2e94386f0df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mp-automator lets DSH agents test WeChat Mini Programs through vince-mp. It reads pages and logs, locates elements, performs selector actions, navigates, and saves screenshots with geometry summaries. Vision routes may receive PNGs. Requires Node, WeChat DevTools and a project-root session.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:311-754","lib/cli.js:232-263"]}
