{"unit_id":"VincentJiang06__dsh-mp-automator#feature-inspect","repo":"VincentJiang06/dsh-mp-automator","commit":"11e7abbd0867e60ad57e97538485b2e94386f0df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mp-automator 的功能「页面与元素检查」：读取路由、页面数据和设备信息，也可按 WXML 选择器查看元素位置、可见状态及重叠候选；通过 mp_inspect 或 mp_query 获取文本事实表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:368-429","lib/facts.js:73-137"]}
{"unit_id":"VincentJiang06__dsh-mp-automator#feature-act","repo":"VincentJiang06/dsh-mp-automator","commit":"11e7abbd0867e60ad57e97538485b2e94386f0df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mp-automator 的功能「选择器交互与导航」：按选择器重新定位元素后执行点击、输入或长按，也支持页面导航、切换 tab、重启路由和注入扫码内容。通过 mp_act 传入动作与选择器或目标参数；操作受构建新鲜度检查约束。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:433-504","lib/index.js:254-260"]}
{"unit_id":"VincentJiang06__dsh-mp-automator#feature-screenshot","repo":"VincentJiang06/dsh-mp-automator","commit":"11e7abbd0867e60ad57e97538485b2e94386f0df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mp-automator 的功能「截图与几何摘要」：保存小程序页面 PNG 并生成元素几何摘要；当当前模型声明支持图片且附件服务可用时，将图片附入上下文，并按会话预算和图片哈希去重。通过 mp_screenshot 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:508-667","lib/facts.js:277-291"]}
{"unit_id":"VincentJiang06__dsh-mp-automator#feature-diagnostics","repo":"VincentJiang06/dsh-mp-automator","commit":"11e7abbd0867e60ad57e97538485b2e94386f0df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mp-automator 的功能「诊断与会话日志」：管理 DevTools 会话，检查项目、微信 CLI、类型检查和构建新鲜度，并读取近期控制台错误；通过 mp_session、mp_doctor、mp_console 使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:311-367","lib/index.js:669-719"]}
